# Scratch review tooling. These drivers say in their own headers that they are
# one-off — they hardcode a single canvas and are meant to be deleted after its
# review — and `_shots/` is the several megabytes of PNGs they render. All of it
# regenerates on demand. `tools/canvas-serve.mjs` is deliberately not here: it
# serves any canvas in `docs/design/` and is tracked.
/docs/design/_shots/
/tools/canvas-verify.mjs
/tools/canvas-details.mjs
/tools/probe-*.mjs
